  "user_intent": {
    "subject": "an elegant adult female fashion model in a long ivory-champagne dress",
    "action": "standing or slowly walking forward with hands behind her back, posture and body language referenced from image 1",
    "environment": "a lush tree-lined park path fused with golden-hour editorial atmosphere and subtle coastal-fashion glamour from image 2",
    "special_requirements": [
      "English prompt around 500 words",
      "perfect fusion of image 1 and image 2 visual style",
      "lighting should lean more strongly toward image 2",
      "character action and pose should reference image 1"
    ]
  },
  "fusion_prompt": "Create a high-end editorial fashion photograph of an elegant adult female model standing full body on a quiet tree-lined park path, her pose clearly inspired by image 1: upright, graceful, facing the camera, one leg subtly forward as if pausing mid-walk, hands held gently behind her back, shoulders relaxed, calm confident presence. She wears a long ivory to champagne cream dress with a refined wrap silhouette, soft vertical ribbed texture near the bodice, a feminine V neckline, delicate short sleeves or softly fitted sleeves, and a modest front slit that reveals one leg in a sophisticated way. Fuse this with the glamour of image 2 by giving the dress a more luxurious evening-wear feeling: slightly longer flowing fabric, lightweight satin-chiffon panels, soft movement at the hem, and subtle translucent edges glowing in the light. The environment should combine the lush green park depth of image 1 with the warm cinematic atmosphere of image 2: an elegant curving walkway, mature trees forming a leafy canopy overhead, blurred benches and vintage park lamps in the background, but all transformed by a golden-hour fashion-magazine mood. Lighting is the priority and should strongly follow image 2: low-angle golden sun from the rear-left side, warm amber rim light outlining the model’s hair, shoulders, arms, and dress edges, luminous backlit fabric, soft atmospheric haze, honey-gold highlight bloom, long delicate shadows on the path, and a gentle sunset glow filtering through leaves. Maintain natural realism while adding editorial polish. Use a warm neutral color system: ivory, champagne, beige, honey gold, soft caramel, muted olive green, and gentle earthy browns; avoid harsh neon colors or cold blue daylight. The green foliage should be rich but slightly desaturated, softened by amber sunlight, so the entire scene feels unified, luxurious, and romantic. Shoot as a professional fashion editorial with a full-frame camera, 85mm or 105mm portrait lens, shallow-to-medium depth of field, compressed background, creamy bokeh, crisp focus on the model and dress texture, subtle film grain, matte skin tones, refined contrast, and soft highlight roll-off. Composition should be vertical, centered, symmetrical enough to feel elegant, with leading lines from the path drawing attention to the model, generous greenery above and around her, and enough negative space for a magazine-cover feeling without adding visible text. The face should be naturally beautiful and softly rendered, not over-retouched, with dark flowing hair catching golden rim light. Overall mood: serene golden-hour glamour, romantic outdoor luxury, graceful femininity, polished fashion photography, cinematic yet believable, as if photographed for a luxury evening-wear campaign in a sunlit botanical promenade. Avoid: cyberpunk lighting, harsh midday sun, over-saturated greens, plastic skin, exaggerated fantasy costume, visible logos, random typography, distorted hands, extra limbs, heavy makeup, low-resolution detail.",
  "style_notes": "融合策略：人物动作、站姿、白色连衣裙与林荫步道参考图1；光影、金色逆光、奢华时装大片质感、暖调胶片氛围明显偏重图2。两图共同 DNA 是户外自然环境、优雅女性全身时装摄影、奶油色/香槟色服装、柔和景深和高级 editorial 质感。图2中的杂志文字元素不作为必要画面内容保留，避免生成模型误写乱码；仅保留其 magazine cover glamour 与 golden hour lighting。建议用于 Midjourney v6.1、Krea 2、FLUX 或 SDXL 写实人像模型。"
}
